    "A ruled banner, no glyph, no clutter",
    "Ribbon bars with the uptime percentage beside each row",
    "No legend: every bar still says what it was",
    "A tab icon that turns the state’s colour",
    "Prints without the colours",
    "Zero custom CSS — every detail is a theme setting"
  ],
